# First Steps. Hitbox right edge = 47 + 2*tick while holding RIGHT; full jump = 20 ticks of JUMP.
96 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # gap at columns 15-16
46 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # step up 2 at column 25
73 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # gap at columns 35-36
47 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # step up 2 at column 45
58 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # gap at columns 53-55
124 RIGHT          # checkpoint, step down at column 63
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # gap at column 71
46 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # step up 2 at column 81
58 RIGHT
20 RIGHT+JUMP      # gap at columns 89-91
300 RIGHT          # step down, run to the exit at column 115
